Grammar

    0 $accept: script $end

    1 script: SHEBANG statements
    2       | statements

    3 statements: newline_list_opt command_list newline_list_opt

    4 command_list: ε
    5             | command_group separator_opt

    6 command_group: pipeline
    7              | command_group separator ws_opt pipeline

    8 separator: SEMI ws_opt newline_list_opt
    9          | newline_list

   10 newline_list: NEWLINE
   11             | newline_list NEWLINE

   12 simple_command: assignment ws_opt
   13               | command ws_opt
   14               | ifelsefi ws_opt

   15 pipeline: simple_command
   16         | pipeline ws_opt PIPE ws_opt simple_command

   17 assignment: ID EQUAL
   18           | ID EQUAL arg

   19 arg: ID
   20    | NUMBER
   21    | MINUS NUMBER
   22    | PLUS NUMBER
   23    | MINUS ID
   24    | PLUS ID
   25    | MINUS MINUS longid
   26    | ID DOT ID
   27    | STRING
   28    | with_dollar
   29    | array

   30 with_dollar: DOLLAR ID
   31            | DOLLAR NUMBER
   32            | DOLLAR DOLLAR
   33            | DOLLAR SOBAKA
   34            | DOLLAR_SHARP
   35            | DOLLAR_BRACED
   36            | DOLLAR LPAREN ws_opt command ws_opt RPAREN

   37 array: LPAREN ws_opt RPAREN
   38      | LPAREN ws_opt elements ws_opt RPAREN

   39 elements: arg
   40         | elements WS arg

   41 longid: ID
   42       | longid MINUS ID

   43 command: longid arg_list

   44 arg_list: ε
   45         | arg_list WS arg
   46         | arg_list WS assignment

   47 ifelsefi: ifthen

   48 ifthen: IF WS LDBRACKET WS arg_list WS RDBRACKET SEMI WS THEN
   49       | IF WS LDBRACKET LDBRACKET WS arg_list WS RDBRACKET RDBRACKET SEMI WS THEN
   50       | IF WS LPAREN LPAREN WS arg_list WS RPAREN RPAREN SEMI WS THEN

   51 separator_opt: ε
   52              | separator

   53 newline_list_opt: ε
   54                 | newline_list

   55 ws_opt: ε
   56       | WS


